Talent Protocol’s pre-launch of the Talent Passport included a campaign for early adopters, such as Celo developers, to bring their professional reputation on-chain and earn rewards. The Prosperity Passport enhances this by offering additional incentives, such as the ability to mint free .celo domain names (for domains with five or more characters, requiring only minimal gas fees of approximately $0.0005). These rewards encourage Talent Protocol users to engage with the Celo ecosystem early, increasing their visibility and potential for recognition.

